      <div class="story-body"><p>When Buddy stopped using his hind legs, we started looking for support. But Buddy is a very large dog, and suitable sizes were hard to find. Cost was another barrier.</p><p class="mt-5">Buddy Wheels began with both needs: a better fit for bigger dogs and a more affordable, repairable design. Printable connections, standard parts, and the testing every size deserves.</p><p class="mt-5 text-sm muted">We have not established a diagnosis or a safe fit for Buddy. Veterinary care comes first.</p></div>
