      <details><summary>Can I order one for my dog today?</summary><p>No. We are developing the product and do not accept orders, deposits or reservations. If your dog needs support now, ask a vet or rehabilitation professional about an available, fitted chair.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the whole wheelchair 3D printed?</summary><p>The proposed design combines printable connectors and fitting parts with standard metal rails, wheels, axles and washable harnesses. Load-bearing printed parts still need testing.</p></details>
